      "captionSha256": "414e9863aade8b2295afacd89abfa43796db888acab44a474d37068503bcaabb"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-brief-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "شبکهٔ هشدار این بخش قطع است. دیده‌بان‌ها از یک کاروان زرهی در جادهٔ غربی خبر می‌دهند. خودروی رادار زمینی ما پس از ورود خودروها به محدودهٔ پوشش، تماس را تأیید می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/m03-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.24,
      "sha256": "e22a45367ce64d3faf6602a63297ddf2d1908e3c2e9fa1e55aee65f87084ceb9",
      "captionSha256": "c335e26c1534b78d933bb79c01710d7e1f6cd2962ec7c215de57824752e6915a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-brief-02",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Hold them at the junction or defend closer to the post. Keep the clinic corridor open. Even an unarmed carrier must not reach the inner core.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/m03-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.16,
      "sha256": "f811bcabcddacf94a759118aa598490bb5112e6dcf8250c29f37c6aec24d654d",
      "captionSha256": "d475cea1cfd3db1d2bbcad759167162f5ae7cd0aeb08aa0a2f890b66f7bfefd5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-brief-02",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "در تقاطع جلوی آن‌ها را بگیرید یا نزدیک‌تر به پاسگاه دفاع کنید. مسیر درمانگاه را باز نگه دارید. حتی نفربر بی‌سلاح هم نباید به محدودهٔ مرکزی برسد.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/m03-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.4,
      "sha256": "cf75f633e053cd423301ebfa3a1e0425ceebb93ad2f331eeeecedd9f3651c890",
      "captionSha256": "748d7cc04f754d39c6dc9663499966754f5e87e62f82b1deb32aa3098d4d4e43"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "We have roughly a minute to prepare. Two rifle squads and a working Barracks are ready. Choose a Tower, a Barrier, or reinforcements. The first warning is an estimate.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/m03-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.88,
      "sha256": "b8370604f91151ce83d33a61b18f840961b442b2b8a043edeac20679887f58a6",
      "captionSha256": "81800c56cda416e8b99140c0a1fbf7690ecc1d198550a82efe63f5ed0e907dae"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "حدود یک دقیقه برای آماده‌شدن فرصت داریم. دو گروه تفنگدار و یک پادگان آماده در اختیار شماست. برج، مانع یا نیروی کمکی را انتخاب کنید. هشدار نخست یک برآورد است.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/m03-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.8,
      "sha256": "90194c559f8f3a2a3d7fec1997280ff681ab9a0d2572aa80cee7d499bdbc0913",
      "captionSha256": "05c52aa1943af804dfa5aca32166453b158464cec6ff2ddc6deaef90de2db4b7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The convoy's departure report matches the warning outage. The timing suggests advance knowledge. Keep defending; we will compare the records afterward.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/m03-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.28,
      "sha256": "6625c63b71452fd678f65b811b3bdb00426c3748e3c275bcc6f1b9d5fd218f66",
      "captionSha256": "d93dec7b5f1450661edf7e7d47dc845c9abce1953ada4b5c2b8e668fc59b0a78"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "زمان حرکت کاروان در گزارش با زمان قطع شبکهٔ هشدار یکی است. این هم‌زمانی نشان از اطلاع قبلی دارد. به دفاع ادامه دهید؛ پس از نبرد سوابق را مقایسه می‌کنیم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/m03-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.4,
      "sha256": "f993f4f4f77bb0a489e30b24ffefc38754095368d96fbaf2ab69cd974c00025c",
      "captionSha256": "aa0788fd832582fc58c13af6120b4cf29d3b7425c7b2f798a51645d92e339d81"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m03-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The convoy is stopped and the post still stands. Check the damage and account for everyone. We need an accurate report.",
