      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "به جادهٔ گزارش‌شده نگاه کنید. این کار فقط دوربین را جابه‌جا می‌کند و دستور گروه‌ها را تغییر نمی‌دهد.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.08,
      "sha256": "914cd2e14dadfb6aefaba1f761f99b1d36be1c27c476ec5ffcba2346c31e6425",
      "captionSha256": "6e1a341435f87bb8817a20bf24182c1b63c348bb7af6eb883c1c9139beaf278a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Defend forward for more interception time, or stay near the post. Keep the inner approach covered.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.04,
      "sha256": "794bb4b7cce90f83c1707d7a5e5d4a6b090ac2063aa9717339ac57271bb4ba1d",
      "captionSha256": "aaae7c4bbf3b08708ee30bba2df22508c6246aa1f4d521cbe033fe01567d636a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "دفاع جلوتر فرصت بیشتری برای توقف کاروان می‌دهد. نزدیک پاسگاه هم می‌توانید دفاع کنید؛ مسیر مرکزی را پوشش دهید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.76,
      "sha256": "5c734590b816295e8a95d18f21f29234ded0eb561ca76f4654506ae76fcb4b25",
      "captionSha256": "c77d7df9cf9a695757f8bec1d18c11eeae246cc1ff548b86e98e68e08e20f0af"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-04",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Open Build and choose a Tower or Barrier. Check the actual cost and valid footprint before confirming. You can skip this lesson.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-04.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.44,
      "sha256": "6a8843625f3d28765ec38ab6e5d8a8e11974336e37db3effeed5df51a7405f37",
      "captionSha256": "79ba2584fea071ea624605e3baacde322ca39c9e104d70f02da3f33fd761a4b3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-04",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "در بخش ساخت، برج یا مانع را انتخاب کنید. پیش از تأیید، هزینه و محل مجاز را بررسی کنید. می‌توانید از این آموزش بگذرید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-04.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.56,
      "sha256": "53fdabb6802e224020624fdeff808fa3e10cf954d465e4fddd0964f9571d6575",
      "captionSha256": "63b4973b9bb9f7612b39611cc9075c212b18350291433fc3b961c91f67337f7b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-05",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select a friendly squad, press Move, then choose a reachable position beside the convoy road. Wait for arrival.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-05.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.0,
      "sha256": "7cff9bcacb8aff49f4abfb09569d53e94878035117c3c05274ae1747119bc32d",
      "captionSha256": "bb7cebe5a7b45931de8c36282fe70f8785e7415c329eac1cb976d1ec973189ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-05",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "گروه خودی را انتخاب کنید، حرکت را بزنید و کنار جادهٔ کاروان مقصدی قابل‌دسترسی تعیین کنید. منتظر رسیدن گروه بمانید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-05.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.4,
      "sha256": "d3c55339a6fe30c30e6173d34438703ea19082028cbf08bd466e96a446674576",
      "captionSha256": "46ece387206cc0f1fc7e3f0d57507138800d21baf7d9b0d0e48067369bc17ba5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-06",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select the squad and press Hold. It defends its position and fires at enemies in range without chasing them.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-06.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 6.96,
      "sha256": "99a7f2069239682b29cd36c35c4ee6f09f986afc3dc680627710635977212ec4",
      "captionSha256": "fd427d1ea1fb464e85474a73edbba74beb664e1e9c78b3546e92ee0c6525e382"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-06",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "گروه را انتخاب کنید و حفظ را بزنید. گروه از موضع خود دفاع می‌کند و بدون تعقیب، به دشمن در برد شلیک می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-06.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.12,
      "sha256": "e811c9ad04f6efe20a39cca8179962494c1abaaa6c5ae6743a5436c4ec76eeca",
      "captionSha256": "22bc4d10c2bb2f7019afff43d42584311bf41538a047a736d563dfe96572a97a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-07",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Stop cancels the selected units' current orders. It does not pause the battle. Skip if you want to keep your current defense.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-07.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.48,
      "sha256": "595b95ae7c9655e49d0f0f430ae8ad48f4fd52d6a4e41b2b6de64c794c0e6ce8",
      "captionSha256": "f97030cca8bd154e9cfee9f50d68db3f8f7ef2a18e3c2394e03153519c41c0b0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-07",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "توقف، دستور فعلی واحدهای انتخاب‌شده را لغو می‌کند؛ نبرد متوقف نمی‌شود. برای حفظ آرایش فعلی می‌توانید از این مرحله بگذرید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-07.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.08,
      "sha256": "88e18eacf9448f741d0afb48816dab6f858c7f52ff82e7f9d434acc055a8e51b",
      "captionSha256": "326d1d4617c408a214246f1249f135298a5b0c697969e32270a0fbbec26a7220"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-08",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Radar Ping scans the living Ground Radar Tank's coverage. Two uses, with a cooldown between them. An empty scan still uses a charge.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-08.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.52,
      "sha256": "04b57259bc71c17900377ba057989b28afe5cf6564a8397589b53010392a1b06",
      "captionSha256": "0d82e7891a7cd76ef8d7b7943416f471eb0c35dd608232ea88db42e1fac9c533"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-08",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "پالس رادار محدودهٔ خودروی رادار زمینیِ سالم را بررسی می‌کند. دو بار قابل‌استفاده است و زمان بازیابی دارد. اسکن بدون تماس هم یک نوبت مصرف می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-08.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.16,
      "sha256": "e57447b2c8fb81d3367b6f41ea4544a88523eed8e9974c677c91c1ec48b35128",
      "captionSha256": "b8bf077cd0b220934fac406fbf1aab544925e80acf7a33ff11b49f1fbaf45222"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-09",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Open the completed Barracks' rifle production. Confirm the displayed cost for a four-person squad. Construction and production remain your choice.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-09.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.08,
      "sha256": "35330d3a773abc3eb820e080a7839cbd46ffbae40d3dc9e34b569ec561ed1ea2",
      "captionSha256": "811feefb4fcfc28b12b49536876182072d25681756edc02d7e37888453910d53"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-09",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "تولید تفنگدار در پادگان آماده را باز کنید. هزینهٔ نمایش‌داده‌شده برای گروه چهارنفری را بررسی کنید. ساخت و تولید به انتخاب شماست.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-09.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.64,
      "sha256": "cca231027d9ce271c0986df90f24a700b5d0be4ea78b0893f25296a9f6d98212",
      "captionSha256": "cb4ab5848a06591114cf4c91b00184b2a87ac8614a139bdfb1b26f8fca15d8ad"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-10",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The armed cars can damage your defense. The unarmed carrier can still breach the core. Choose targets you have confirmed.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-10.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.4,
      "sha256": "270ac6cc4cdc3993031d7b53414f8d8c5a3c5fc7df0d7d8636ee3c9c922b95c1",
      "captionSha256": "a358b2f0fe202138ff0c7f2a737b965c0d1c542fbb56037f82f2a0540c25fd72"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-10",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "خودروهای مسلح به مدافعان آسیب می‌زنند. نفربر بی‌سلاح هم می‌تواند وارد محدودهٔ مرکزی شود. هدف تأییدشده را انتخاب کنید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-10.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.08,
      "sha256": "2de6c81e9341d1a959ff6398bc4b712717464c28559b3f64f4a2f92fbee6a59c",
      "captionSha256": "e73a6ecab88d4027b3388dec605214afe1f766f6b222c063a7384c15fde9444c"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-11",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Read the second warning and check your surviving squads. Reposition if needed while keeping the approach to the post covered.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-11.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.68,
      "sha256": "bb18900c84e196d58337a8716ee0d75b2c3c1c377bbcea00c0e8c2e192d6c516",
      "captionSha256": "c6c0f5a8e6e5ac75d721bebe39f2d8e3f2dfc31192bb57f4318b98650f264d33"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-11",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "هشدار دوم و وضعیت نیروهای باقی‌مانده را بررسی کنید. در صورت نیاز جابه‌جا شوید و مسیر پاسگاه را پوشش دهید.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-11.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.12,
      "sha256": "06a81bd43169a81ae86ea86a6066131ded1c48c23723df351fc4cb0e2c462d1c",
      "captionSha256": "262a875337d07974e994659df170a64ca837774446108db3764ce694f6c195c7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-12",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Victory requires stopping both elements and keeping the post and core safe. Civilian losses and post damage affect separate bonus stars.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/en/tutorial-m03-12.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.92,
      "sha256": "642d556b81bccf286b13618bf4fc27d1d220068fd27d3a84c370d7366b0b8686",
      "captionSha256": "9a428461c0471eff5baa786a789d721897cca53ae011f36dbd2cc1425a67c34e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m03-12",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "برای پیروزی هر دو بخش کاروان را متوقف و پاسگاه و مرکز را حفظ کنید. تلفات غیرنظامی و آسیب پاسگاه، ستاره‌های امتیازی جداگانه را کم می‌کنند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M03RadarWarning/Voice/fa/tutorial-m03-12.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.56,
      "sha256": "7df76764fe249e6bb8395ecad133ce24a7339ea1a9da9c234310259b4e673c8c",
      "captionSha256": "d012a522efd02bfd948e7a1d804f5ac4f8c97121194669bf0bf10bcc5a5ae255"
    }
  ]
}
